on ChangeToStage SpritNr
  [  0] getparam 0 .............................. <SpritNr>
  [  2] pushint8 18 ............................. <18>
  [  4] eq ...................................... <SpritNr = 18>
  [  5] jmpifz [ 17] ............................ if SpritNr = 18 then
  [  8] pushint8 18 ............................. <18>
  [ 10] pushint8 440 ............................ <440>
  [ 13] pushint8 4 .............................. <4>
  [ 15] set 6 ................................... set the castNum of sprite 18 to 440
  [ 17] ret
end
